TI  - Anterior cruciate ligament reconstruction combined with anterolateral ligament reconstruction using hamstring autograft versus anterior cruciate ligament reconstruction using bone-patellar tendon-bone autograft: a randomised controlled trial with 5-year f
AU  - Sonnery-Cottet B
AU  - Carrozzo A
AU  - Poilvache H
AU  - Fayard JM
AU  - Freychet B
AU  - Thaunat M
AU  - Vieira TD
